a256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"约鹅湖费阁老明年同游武夷山因作短歌二首赠别 其二","author":"孙一元","text":"野鹤照衣来清濆，山树开花留白云。\n他日移居溪水上，道衣同拜武夷君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2745,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢方方伯寿卿惠米","author":"孙一元","text":"耽贫自笑山人瘦，饱饭还歌方伯贤。\n白石铛中消岁月，漫炊松火汲清泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2746,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中酒闭门一月偶出晚步戏成小句","author":"孙一元","text":"燕麦花开春亦移，道人扶杖下山时。\n独醒免使渔翁笑，捲叶分泉当酒卮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2747,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读李世卿大厓文集二首柬乃弟立卿宪长 其一","author":"孙一元","text":"丰芑多才世亦雍，文章犹见昔贤风。\n天根悟处梅花早，要有江门一老翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2748,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读李世卿大厓文集二首柬乃弟立卿宪长 其二","author":"孙一元","text":"杖屦当年谁与从，白云回首有高踪。\n畸人随化文章在，我梦罗浮四百峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2749,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访钱隐君","author":"孙一元","text":"隐君南国旧王孙，小筑茅堂水竹村。\n我亦江湖陆鲁望，钓竿独抱访柴门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2750,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖","author":"孙一元","text":"门前云物时来宿，沙上鸥群亦自呼。\n背郭不知有城府，矮床竹树坐临湖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2751,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阳羡山人","author":"孙一元","text":"阳羡山人戴鹖冠，偶来白日游尘寰。\n云霞一夜忽入梦，却骑麋鹿还青山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2752,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"坐竹林精舍","author":"孙一元","text":"高帻短袍云霞光，扁舟系缆野篱傍。\n焚香静坐了无语，山寺闭门春竹长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2753,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江南大水歌六首 其一","author":"孙一元","text":"扬子具区波势连，吴门淞泖尽云烟。\n郎家住处今何地，长日挂冠愁不前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2754,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江南大水歌六首 其二","author":"孙一元","text":"落日薄山风蹙波，天吴九首海云多。\n茫茫一望愁无那，听妾劝公无渡河。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2755,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江南大水歌六首 其三","author":"孙一元","text":"日黄抱晕天风号，海若鶱腾白浪摇。\n连山浮石来喷雪，恰似曲江八月潮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2756,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江南大水歌六首 其四","author":"孙一元","text":"却疑地轴折中流，雨倒风翻不肯休。\n飞阁横梁通海气，鸣鸥浴鹭失汀洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2757,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江南大水歌六首 其五","author":"孙一元","text":"海侧江翻地不毛，崖危石断日吞潮。\n时闻西北犹巡狩，不见东南亲射蛟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2758,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江南大水歌六首 其六","author":"孙一元","text":"宿云积雾昼长昏，滔日浮山白浪吞。\n空道武皇塞瓠子，还须神禹凿龙门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2759,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浔阳歌十首 其一","author":"孙一元","text":"半夜烟飞杀气横，水军攻破九江城。\n天子垂衣正南面，殊方逆贼敢称兵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2760,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浔阳歌十首 其二","author":"孙一元","text":"画舰彫戈兵势来，南康已破九江摧。\n鄱阳潋滟空愁目，庐阜崔嵬作战台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2761,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]